 M3 M4 Mini 1st 2 3 4 5th 6th A17 Pro Pro 1st 2nd 3rd 4th 5th 6th M4 M5\nThe iPad Air (retrospectively referred to unofficially as the iPad Air 1 or original iPad Air ) is a tablet computer developed and marketed by Apple Inc. It was announced on Octob…","date":"2026-08-09T00:30:12.000Z","content":"1st 2 3rd 4th 5th 6th 7th 8th 9th 10th 11th Air 1st 2 3rd 4th 5th M2 M3 M4 Mini 1st 2 3 4 5th 6th A17 Pro Pro 1st 2nd 3rd 4th 5th 6th M4 M5\nThe iPad Air (retrospectively referred to unofficially as the iPad Air 1 or original iPad Air ) is a tablet computer developed and marketed by Apple Inc. It was announced on October 22, 2013 and released on November 1, 2013. Part of the iPad line of tablet computers, the iPad Air features a thinner design than its predecessors (particularly the iPad (4th generation) [ 5 ] ), with similarities to the contemporaneous iPad Mini 2 .\nThe iPad Air's successor, the iPad Air 2 , was announced on October 16, 2014, and released on October 22, 2014, however, the 64 GB and 128 GB variants were discontinued, and later the 16 GB and 32 GB on March 21, 2016, after the announcement of the 9.7-inch iPad Pro . [ 6 ]","domain":"en.wikipedia.org","engines":["web"]},{"title":"Apple AirPods Pro 3","url":"https://swappa.com/listing/view/LAGJ68495","snippet":"$257 Login to Buy","date":"2026-08-18T05:04:12.000Z","domain":"swappa.com","engines":["web"]},{"title":"Apple AirPods Pro 3","url":"https://swappa.com/listing/view/LAIH28615","snippet":"$182 Login to Buy","date":"2026-08-17T17:15:37.000Z","domain":"swappa.com","engines":["web"]},{"title":"Apple AirPods Pro 3","url":"https://swappa.com/listing/view/LAGF90952","snippet":"$181 Login to Buy","date":"2026-08-17T12:51:17.000Z","domain":"swappa.com","engines":["web"]},{"title":"Apple AirPods Pro 3","url":"https://swappa.com/listing/view/LAIH20117","snippet":"$182 Login to Buy","date":"2026-08-14T23:10:16.000Z","domain":"swappa.com","engines":["web"]},{"title":"AirPods","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ai